  "title": "09 · Agents & Skills Map",
  "description": "This page is the single map of **every dedicated instruction file baked into this repo**, **which coding agent auto-discovers each one**, and **every baked-in workflow skill** any agent can be pointed at for a specific task. It exists so no agent has to guess where its own rules live, and so every agent's rules stay in sync instead of drifting into separate copies.",
